<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>The macro for the game «Locked» in Roblox kicks the ball up, activates formless, then does a 180 degree turn. It is recommended to use a sensitivity of 0.171 at a resolution of 800 DPI in Roblox. The 1920 x 1080 resolution is considered optimal, but you can choose any other one, since the mouse movement depends on the relative coordinates. Because of the perfect U-turn, you may be suspected of using macros, so adjust the coordinates at the end as you see fit.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
